    <DataNode elementId="AT4G02500-MONOMER" textLabel="Xyloglucan 6-xylosyltransferase 2" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="O22775" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="300" centerY="475" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">This enzyme, which belongs to CAZy glycosyl transferase family GT34, catalyzes the transfer of xylose from |FRAME: UDP-D-XYLOSE UDP-&amp;alpha;-D-xylose| onto &amp;beta;(1,4)-linked glucan chains The enzyme preferentially adds one xylose to unsubstituted glucans at the fourth position from the reducing end. When using |FRAME: CPD-13237 cellopentaose| (GGGGG) as substrate the enzyme produced mostly GXGGG, with minor amounts of XGGGG and GGXGG. Activity with |FRAME: CPD-13238 cellohexaose| was 4-fold higher, and produced GGXGGG |CITS: [16982611]|. Under high donor concentrations and longer incubation time the enzyme also adds a second xylose at the third position from the reducing end, forming GGXXGG |CITS: [16982611]|. Very small amounts of tri-xylosylated molecules GXXXGG) were also detected. The |FRAME: TAX-3702 &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt;| |FRAME: AT4G02500 XXT2| gene was cloned and overexpressed in insect cells, and detergent-slubilized extracts were analyzed for activity |CITS: [16982611]|. The activities of |FRAME: AT3G62720 XXT1| and |FRAME: AT4G02500 XXT2| appear identical &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt;.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT4G02500-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT4G02500.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="O22775" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="AtXT2" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="Putative glycosyltransferase 2" />
      <Property key="Synonym_3" value="AtGT2" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-33399, RXN-19229, RXN-12805, RXN-11300" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="4" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT4G02500.1" />
      <Property key="FunctionalAssignmentStatus" value=":PROBABLE-ENZYME" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT4G02500" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_16982611" />
