      <Xref identifier="Q9LZJ3" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="150" centerY="555" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="THE-ARABIDOPSIS-INFORMATION-RESOURCE, karthik">This enzyme, which belongs to CAZy glycosyl transferase family GT34, catalyzes the transfer of xylose from |FRAME: UDP-D-XYLOSE UDP-&amp;alpha;-D-xylose| onto &amp;beta;(1,4)-linked glucan chains The enzyme preferentially adds one xylose to unsubstituted glucans at the fourth position from the reducing end. When using |FRAME: CPD-13237 cellopentaose| (GGGGG) as substrate the enzyme produced mostly GXGGG, with minor amounts of XGGGG and GGXGG |CITS: [12032363]|. Activity with |FRAME: CPD-13238 cellohexaose| was 4-fold higher, and produced GGXGGG |CITS: [16982611]|. Under high donor concentrations and longer incubation time the enzyme also adds a second xylose at the third position from the reducing end, forming GGXXGG |CITS: [16982611]|. Very small amounts of the tri-xylosylated molecule GXXXGG were also detected. The |FRAME: TAX-3702 &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt;| |FRAME: AT3G62720 XXT1| gene was cloned and overexpressed in the yeast |FRAME: TAX-4922 &lt;i&gt;Pichia pastoris&lt;/i&gt;|, and the recombinant protein was patially purified and analyzed for activity |CITS: [12032363]|. A preformed precursor molecule is necessary for the addition of xylose. The enzyme from pea requires a minimum size of five glucose residues, while the enzyme from Arabidopsis requires only four. Large molecules, such as |FRAME: Carboxymethylcellulose carboxymethyl cellulose|, were also used |CITS: [12032363]|. The activities of |FRAME: AT3G62720 XXT1| and |FRAME: AT4G02500 XXT2| appear identical &lt;i&gt;in vitro&lt;/i&gt;.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT3G62720-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT3G62720.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Uniprot" value="Q9LZJ3" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-33393, RXN-11314, RXN-15011" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="3" />
